      "text": "To find the perimeter of triangle \\( X Y Z \\), we need to determine the lengths of the sides \\( X Y \\), \\( Y Z \\), and \\( Z X \\).\n\nFirst, let's compute the lengths of \\( X Y \\), \\( Y Z \\), and \\( Z X \\):\n\n1. Calculate the distance \\( X Y \\).\n\nInitially, we note that \\( X \\) and \\( Y \\) lie on segments \\( AC \\) and \\( BC \\) respectively. The coordinates of \\( X \\) are:\n\\[\nX = \\left( \\frac{A+C}{2} \\right) = \\left( \\frac{0+6}{2}, \\frac{0-6}{2} \\right) = (3, -3)\n\\]\nand the coordinates of \\( Y \\) are:\n\\[\nY = \\left( \\frac{B+C}{2} \\right) = \\left( \\frac{12+6}{2}, \\frac{0-6}{2} \\right) = (9, -3)\n\\]\n\nNext, measure the distance \\( X Y \\):\n\\[\n\\overline{X Y} = \\sqrt{(9-3)^2 + (-3 - (-3))^2} = \\sqrt{(6)^2 + (0)^2} = \\sqrt{36} = 6\n\\]\n\n2. Calculate the distance \\( Y Z \\).\n\nNext, the points \\( Y \\) and \\( Z \\) lie on segments \\( BC \\) and \\( CD \\) respectively. The coordinates of \\( Y \\) are \\((9, -3)\\) and the coordinates of \\( Z \\) are:\n\\[\nZ = \\left( \\frac{C+D}{2} \\right) = \\left( \\frac{6-22}{2}, \\frac{-22+6}{2} \\right) = (-8, -8)\n\\]\n\nNext, calculate the distance \\( Y Z \\):\n\\[\n\\overline{Y Z} = \\sqrt{(-8-9)^2 + (-8 - (-3))^2} = \\sqrt{(-17)^2 + (-5)^2} = \\sqrt{289 + 25} = \\sqrt{314} = \\sqrt{314}\n\\]\n\n3. Calculate the distance \\( Z X \\)\n\nIn this case, points \\( Z \\) and \\( X \\) lie on segments \\( CD \\) and \\( AC \\) respectively. The coordinates of \\( Z \\) are \\((-8, -8)\\) and the coordinates of \\( X \\) are \\((3, -3)\\).\n\nNext, compute the distance \\( Z X \\):\n\\[\n\\overline{X Z} = \\sqrt{(3 - (-8))^2 + (-3 - (-8))^2} = \\sqrt{(11)^2 + (5)^2} = \\sqrt{121 + 25} = \\sqrt{146}\n\\]\n\nNow, we can find the perimeter of \\( \\overline{X Y} + \\overline{Y Z} + \\overline{Z X} \\):\n\\[\n\\overline{X Y} = 6, \\quad \\overline{Y Z} = \\sqrt{314}, \\quad \\overline{Z X} = \\sqrt{146}\n\\]\n\nSum the distances:\n\\[\n\\overline{X Y} + \\overline{Y Z} + \\overline{Z X} = 6 + \\sqrt{314} + \\sqrt{146} \n\\]\n\nThus, the final answer is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{6 + \\sqrt{314} + \\sqrt{146}}\n\\]",
